CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/bk com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/ProjectileSpawnEntry
	COMMENT One "name(*count)(params)" entry of a ProjectileList. Fields, all named after the ini parameters parsed in ProjectileList: projectileReference (ProjectileReference), count, spawnChance (1.0 default), maxSpawnLimit (Integer.MAX_VALUE default), offsetX/offsetY/offsetHeight/offsetDir, xOffsetRelative/yOffsetRelative, offsetRandomX/offsetRandomY/offsetRandomDir and recursionLimit (3 default). [field names verified from the ini parser]
	FIELD a projectileReference Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/x;
	FIELD b count I
	FIELD c spawnChance F
	FIELD d maxSpawnLimit I
	FIELD e offsetX F
	FIELD f offsetY F
	FIELD g offsetHeight F
	FIELD h offsetDir F
	FIELD i xOffsetRelative F
	FIELD j yOffsetRelative F
	FIELD k offsetRandomX F
	FIELD l offsetRandomY F
	FIELD m offsetRandomDir F
	FIELD n recursionLimit I
